  "id": "lightning-boss-storm-call",
  "name": "Boss Storm Call",
  "description": "A boss calls down one colossal strike. A wide ring of static marks the danger zone for over half a second, then a thick forked bolt slams down, restrikes three times and blasts a shockwave, sparks and a big scorch across the area.",
