  "variation": {
    "seeded": true,
    "notes": "Bolt path, fork pattern, side-strand shape, spark spray and shake strength change per cast. Timing and the warning-ring size stay fixed: players learn the 650 ms telegraph and the danger radius."
  },
  "director_notes": "Request: heavy boss lightning for a top-down game, so the hero view is top and the ground carries the effect: a wide warning ring with static during a long 650 ms charge (fair telegraph for a boss attack), then a 210 px shockwave and 120 px scorch. Weight comes from the long charge against a 90 ms strike with a held frame, three restrikes and heavy shake. Violet palette sets it apart from the natural blue sky strike. A thin regenerating side strand twists around the solid main bolt so the column reads thick from front and side."
